    "description": "Text → MIDI (midi-llm) → PreviewMidi / SaveMidi, plus SynthMidi (pretty_midi DSP) → Normalize → Preview/SaveAudio. No MusicGen — commercially clear render path. Install midi-llm (Mac MPS) before real Render; path demo: midi-gen.",
